Set overlay profile for a game

Usage:
  spela overlay set <game> [flags]

Flags:
      --enabled string          Enable performance overlay (true/false)
  -h, --help                    help for set
      --position string         Overlay screen position (top-left/top-right/bottom-left/bottom-right)
      --show-cpu string         Show CPU usage (true/false)
      --show-fps string         Show frames per second (true/false)
      --show-frametime string   Show frame time (true/false)
      --show-gpu string         Show GPU usage (true/false)
      --show-vram string        Show VRAM usage (true/false)
      --toggle-key string       Key to toggle overlay visibility
